appmenu-gtk-module (1:25.04-0caminito1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Caminito's patched appmenu-gtk-module, from Ubuntu 26.04's 25.04-1build1
    (CMN-125).
  * Add epoch 1: 25.04-0caminito1 sorts below Ubuntu's 25.04-1build1, and no
    stock version may satisfy Caminito's dependencies (ADR 0029).
  * Build from vala-panel-appmenu's 25.04 tag, the tree the fixes are
    against, in its subprojects/appmenu-gtk-module. Move
    1001_fix-soversion.patch to that path.
  * Carry packaging/patches/appmenu-gtk-module/, two fixes for Wayland.
    tools/debian-build copies them into debian/patches/.
  * Install /usr/share/caminito/appmenu-gtk-module in appmenu-gtk3-module,
    by which Caminito's session finds the patched module.
  * Pin the binaries at their caminito version in
    /etc/apt/preferences.d/caminito-appmenu-gtk-module (ADR 0029).

 -- jpablo <jpablolassala@gmail.com>  Wed, 21 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

